    "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 361.93,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "子君，你知道中国哪里最有人情味吗？每年农历七月，潮汕有一个特别震撼的场面，家家户户都会在门前摆满米饭、肉、山、水果等等祭品，这叫什么？这叫师孤。师孤祭奠的并不是自己家的先祖，而是那些无主孤魂。他孤祭拜的是为国捐躯的战士，逃荒，饿死的百姓，客死他乡的游子，那些没有后代的人怎么办呢？没有人知道他们坟在哪里，没有儿女来祭。潮汕说，那我们来祭拜，我不知道你是谁，也不知道你从哪里来。但既然你和我一样，在人世间走过一遭，就不应该没有一口饭吃，没有一柱香火，所以我们给你留一份。你再看潮汕诗，故最后的贡品都去了，哪里都送给了当地贫穷的乡亲民失孤魂，暗失贫苦，这是封建迷信吗？不是，这是潮汕人的慈悲和大爱。这一刻，我敬潮汕。所谓人情味，就是哪怕你已经离开这个世界，我也希望这个世界还有人对你好一点。祭祖是不忘自己的来处，而师姑是不忍别人没有归处在。潮汕生者有所养，逝者有所念，孤折亦有所安都。说潮汕人迷信，不管走到哪里，都要拜老爷修祠堂，但真相能够让你起一身鸡皮疙瘩潮汕。很多祠堂门头上写着颍川世家，但你知道吗？颍川其实远在河南，而这些人在广东住了近千年，为什么把河南挂在门兜上？其实不止颖川去潮汕随便一座祠堂，抬头看到门头上，基本上写的是北方地名。汾河旧家是山鸡，陇西市驾是甘肃，江夏，是湖北琅琊市、山东等等。历史上，中原战乱和剃发令，他们的祖先一次次衣冠难度，背着祖宗的牌位，背着祖父，背着家乡的古音，躲进了这一方角落。他们在南方定居了几百年上千年，有的甚至漂洋过海去了南阳去了欧洲。但只要修祠堂，就一定会把老祖宗起家的地方刻在门头之上。这不是迷信，他们是太忘记自己从哪里来，害怕忘了这身血脉死亡。不可怕，遗忘才可怕。在潮汕，只要走进祠堂，你就知道你不是无名之辈，你身后站着千军万马的祖先。每年农历三月十九，潮汕人都要祭拜太阳宫。外地人不知道的是三月十九是明朝崇祯皇帝。在眉山自缢的日子，清军入关，不准汉人祭拜前朝大明。于是他们就把大明宫改叫太阳宫。他们祭奠的是那个风雨飘摇的汉家江山，而这一代就是三百年心照不宣。潮汕人跪下来的第一句就是风调雨顺，国泰民安。他们拜的不是神，是文化，是再也回不去的大名。还有潮汕老人去世入店的时候，绝对不能穿马褂和旗袍，必须穿明朝款式的衣服。大金山宽袖子活着，没有办法剃发易服做了顺明，但走的时候必须穿汉家衣冠，去见祖宗，死了也要堂堂正正做汉人。再看这个火遍全网的潮汕莺歌舞，这可不是乱跳。这其实是古代汉人军政的走为汉族人，放下锤子，是农民，拿起锤子能杀敌。这股的路见不平，一声吼的血腥，被潮汕人完完整整守了下来。脸涂油彩，手持双棍步伐踏的地动山腰。在电影给阿妈的情书里，男女主人公初相识的场景就是莺歌舞扛飙旗。尹老爷的画面都说五十六个民族五十五个，能歌善，唯独汉族人不能歌也不能舞。其实莺歌舞就是我们汉族人自己的特色舞蹈。莺歌舞燃的就是汉人，骨子里那股不服输的劲儿，没有退路，只有向前冲。潮汕人真的把信仰做到了极致，就算是莺歌陆逊遇到台风、暴雨，孩子们也是迎难而上整个村子。少男少女发动全村来训练，没有人缺席，没有人推脱，没有任何金钱报酬。而今年潮汕揭阳新兵入也是莺歌舞开路，潮汕宗祠在当地捐了许多免费的养老院和儿童福利院，很多叔公阿姨在膳堂做了一辈子义工。这一刻，我相信，如果世间有神明，那一定在汕头。你看这是潮汕的妈祖花灯巡游掉队的父子，全场围观的都是善意的鼓励，没有什么嘲讽。爸爸全力抱起儿子，最后冲刺进祠堂。宗族对一个垫底的落后的弟子都那么爱护顾虑，可想这样的宗族会一直强盛下去。信仰的背后是人情味，所以潮商很喜欢自己人帮自己人，而你知道潮汕人有多牛吗？香港首富，李嘉诚，泰国首富谢国民，新加坡首富吴清亮、亚洲首富陈碧晨，世界上最富有的十二大银行家都是潮汕人。全球一百位华人首富当中，潮汕人占了三分之一，欧美各地的华人首富也全都是潮汕人，就连泰国王室的祖先正姓大帝也是潮汕人，是中国历史上第一位在海外称帝的华人。泰国十大富豪有八位，都是潮汕人，有潮水的地方，就有潮汕人。诸君，你知道民间哪里？神仙最多吗？当属潮汕天庭的收入，据说一半靠潮汕。若是见到天帝父母，这样的标识，拜的就是天宫玉皇大帝和他的妻子后土娘娘。若是见到白脸红脸、黑脸一起出现，就潮汕顶流老爷三山国王。若是位于灶台之上，则是最不能得罪的神明。司命公张丹也被称之为灶神，是百姓的家。内神就是先谱圣庙风雨圣者升殿一事。我一直以为我们没有汉文化，没想到汉文话都在广东潮汕，无论何时何地，只要一句老要保侯，就能给潮汕人注入力量，你知道吗？潮汕祭祖最重要的不是求祖先保佑我，而是提醒自己，别辜负祖先，我不能给祖先丢人。没有谁是真正的白手企业家，你的起点就是祖辈几代人的终点。一个家族最贵的遗产，不是上一代留下多少钱，而是下一代。提起这个家族，就会说一句，我们家祖祖辈辈都是认真生活，堂堂正正的人。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "子君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1070,
      "end_ms": 3330,
      "text": "你知道中国哪里最有人情味吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3510,
      "end_ms": 4710,
      "text": "每年农历七月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4930,
      "end_ms": 6930,
      "text": "潮汕有一个特别震撼的场面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7250,
      "end_ms": 11470,
      "text": "家家户户都会在门前摆满米饭、肉、山、水果等等祭品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11650,
      "end_ms": 12370,
      "text": "这叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12470,
      "end_ms": 13570,
      "text": "这叫师孤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14110,
      "end_ms": 16309,
      "text": "师孤祭奠的并不是自己家的先祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 16410,
      "end_ms": 18170,
      "text": "而是那些无主孤魂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 18590,
      "end_ms": 20810,
      "text": "他孤祭拜的是为国捐躯的战士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20990,
      "end_ms": 21470,
      "text": "逃荒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21490,
      "end_ms": 22310,
      "text": "饿死的百姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 22510,
      "end_ms": 23850,
      "text": "客死他乡的游子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 24250,
      "end_ms": 26070,
      "text": "那些没有后代的人怎么办呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 26290,
      "end_ms": 27990,
      "text": "没有人知道他们坟在哪里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 28050,
      "end_ms": 29130,
      "text": "没有儿女来祭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 29530,
      "end_ms": 30380,
      "text": "潮汕说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 30520,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "那我们来祭拜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 31900,
      "end_ms": 33040,
      "text": "我不知道你是谁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 33360,
      "end_ms": 34840,
      "text": "也不知道你从哪里来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 35060,
      "end_ms": 36400,
      "text": "但既然你和我一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 36400,
      "end_ms": 37820,
      "text": "在人世间走过一遭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 38080,
      "end_ms": 39560,
      "text": "就不应该没有一口饭吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 39760,
      "end_ms": 40760,
      "text": "没有一柱香火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 40940,
      "end_ms": 42620,
      "text": "所以我们给你留一份。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 43000,
      "end_ms": 44060,
      "text": "你再看潮汕诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 44060,
      "end_ms": 45240,
      "text": "故最后的贡品都去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 45240,
      "end_ms": 49620,
      "text": "哪里都送给了当地贫穷的乡亲民失孤魂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 49760,
      "end_ms": 50760,
      "text": "暗失贫苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 50980,
      "end_ms": 52240,
      "text": "这是封建迷信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 52340,
      "end_ms": 52840,
      "text": "不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 53000,
      "end_ms": 55060,
      "text": "这是潮汕人的慈悲和大爱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 55220,
      "end_ms": 55720,
      "text": "这一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 55880,
      "end_ms": 56860,
      "text": "我敬潮汕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 57080,
      "end_ms": 58060,
      "text": "所谓人情味，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 58240,
      "end_ms": 60555,
      "text": "就是哪怕你已经离开这个世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 60820,
      "end_ms": 63405,
      "text": "我也希望这个世界还有人对你好一点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 63910,
      "end_ms": 65690,
      "text": "祭祖是不忘自己的来处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 65810,
      "end_ms": 69440,
      "text": "而师姑是不忍别人没有归处在。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 69440,
      "end_ms": 71485,
      "text": "潮汕生者有所养，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 71820,
      "end_ms": 73095,
      "text": "逝者有所念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 73400,
      "end_ms": 75470,
      "text": "孤折亦有所安都。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 75470,
      "end_ms": 76610,
      "text": "说潮汕人迷信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 76610,
      "end_ms": 77370,
      "text": "不管走到哪里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 77370,
      "end_ms": 78790,
      "text": "都要拜老爷修祠堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 79110,
      "end_ms": 82090,
      "text": "但真相能够让你起一身鸡皮疙瘩潮汕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 82090,
      "end_ms": 84315,
      "text": "很多祠堂门头上写着颍川世家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 84540,
      "end_ms": 85195,
      "text": "但你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 85480,
      "end_ms": 87105,
      "text": "颍川其实远在河南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 87590,
      "end_ms": 89510,
      "text": "而这些人在广东住了近千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 89610,
      "end_ms": 91385,
      "text": "为什么把河南挂在门兜上？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 91720,
      "end_ms": 94200,
      "text": "其实不止颖川去潮汕随便一座祠堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 94200,
      "end_ms": 95160,
      "text": "抬头看到门头上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 95160,
      "end_ms": 96845,
      "text": "基本上写的是北方地名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 97210,
      "end_ms": 98515,
      "text": "汾河旧家是山鸡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 98790,
      "end_ms": 100050,
      "text": "陇西市驾是甘肃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 100230,
      "end_ms": 100710,
      "text": "江夏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 100770,
      "end_ms": 102855,
      "text": "是湖北琅琊市、山东等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 103390,
      "end_ms": 103910,
      "text": "历史上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 103910,
      "end_ms": 105345,
      "text": "中原战乱和剃发令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 105610,
      "end_ms": 108015,
      "text": "他们的祖先一次次衣冠难度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 108240,
      "end_ms": 109360,
      "text": "背着祖宗的牌位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 109360,
      "end_ms": 110020,
      "text": "背着祖父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 110020,
      "end_ms": 111180,
      "text": "背着家乡的古音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 111380,
      "end_ms": 112685,
      "text": "躲进了这一方角落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 113000,
      "end_ms": 115375,
      "text": "他们在南方定居了几百年上千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 115610,
      "end_ms": 118075,
      "text": "有的甚至漂洋过海去了南阳去了欧洲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 118720,
      "end_ms": 120040,
      "text": "但只要修祠堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 120040,
      "end_ms": 123395,
      "text": "就一定会把老祖宗起家的地方刻在门头之上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 123650,
      "end_ms": 124545,
      "text": "这不是迷信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 124840,
      "end_ms": 126760,
      "text": "他们是太忘记自己从哪里来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 126860,
      "end_ms": 129210,
      "text": "害怕忘了这身血脉死亡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 129210,
      "end_ms": 129765,
      "text": "不可怕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 130070,
      "end_ms": 131065,
      "text": "遗忘才可怕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 131420,
      "end_ms": 131935,
      "text": "在潮汕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 132200,
      "end_ms": 133300,
      "text": "只要走进祠堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 133400,
      "end_ms": 135410,
      "text": "你就知道你不是无名之辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 135490,
      "end_ms": 137765,
      "text": "你身后站着千军万马的祖先。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 138260,
      "end_ms": 139680,
      "text": "每年农历三月十九，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 139780,
      "end_ms": 141555,
      "text": "潮汕人都要祭拜太阳宫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 141880,
      "end_ms": 145190,
      "text": "外地人不知道的是三月十九是明朝崇祯皇帝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 145190,
      "end_ms": 146515,
      "text": "在眉山自缢的日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 146930,
      "end_ms": 147650,
      "text": "清军入关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 147650,
      "end_ms": 149530,
      "text": "不准汉人祭拜前朝大明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 149550,
      "end_ms": 152185,
      "text": "于是他们就把大明宫改叫太阳宫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 152430,
      "end_ms": 155350,
      "text": "他们祭奠的是那个风雨飘摇的汉家江山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 155490,
      "end_ms": 158065,
      "text": "而这一代就是三百年心照不宣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 158510,
      "end_ms": 161470,
      "text": "潮汕人跪下来的第一句就是风调雨顺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 161650,
      "end_ms": 162635,
      "text": "国泰民安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 163090,
      "end_ms": 164110,
      "text": "他们拜的不是神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 164430,
      "end_ms": 165130,
      "text": "是文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 165290,
      "end_ms": 166765,
      "text": "是再也回不去的大名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 167250,
      "end_ms": 168990,
      "text": "还有潮汕老人去世入店的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 168990,
      "end_ms": 170625,
      "text": "绝对不能穿马褂和旗袍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 170870,
      "end_ms": 172465,
      "text": "必须穿明朝款式的衣服。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 172850,
      "end_ms": 175180,
      "text": "大金山宽袖子活着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 175180,
      "end_ms": 177220,
      "text": "没有办法剃发易服做了顺明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 177220,
      "end_ms": 179400,
      "text": "但走的时候必须穿汉家衣冠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 179500,
      "end_ms": 180360,
      "text": "去见祖宗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 180520,
      "end_ms": 182855,
      "text": "死了也要堂堂正正做汉人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 183430,
      "end_ms": 185645,
      "text": "再看这个火遍全网的潮汕莺歌舞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 185990,
      "end_ms": 186895,
      "text": "这可不是乱跳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 187190,
      "end_ms": 189940,
      "text": "这其实是古代汉人军政的走为汉族人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 189940,
      "end_ms": 190680,
      "text": "放下锤子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 190680,
      "end_ms": 191200,
      "text": "是农民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 191280,
      "end_ms": 192765,
      "text": "拿起锤子能杀敌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 193080,
      "end_ms": 194140,
      "text": "这股的路见不平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 194140,
      "end_ms": 195040,
      "text": "一声吼的血腥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 195040,
      "end_ms": 197085,
      "text": "被潮汕人完完整整守了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 197550,
      "end_ms": 198390,
      "text": "脸涂油彩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 198390,
      "end_ms": 200915,
      "text": "手持双棍步伐踏的地动山腰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 201320,
      "end_ms": 202800,
      "text": "在电影给阿妈的情书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 202820,
      "end_ms": 206460,
      "text": "男女主人公初相识的场景就是莺歌舞扛飙旗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 206500,
      "end_ms": 209590,
      "text": "尹老爷的画面都说五十六个民族五十五个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 209590,
      "end_ms": 210110,
      "text": "能歌善，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 210170,
      "end_ms": 212065,
      "text": "唯独汉族人不能歌也不能舞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 212340,
      "end_ms": 215405,
      "text": "其实莺歌舞就是我们汉族人自己的特色舞蹈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 215810,
      "end_ms": 217550,
      "text": "莺歌舞燃的就是汉人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 217550,
      "end_ms": 219225,
      "text": "骨子里那股不服输的劲儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 219420,
      "end_ms": 220120,
      "text": "没有退路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 220180,
      "end_ms": 221240,
      "text": "只有向前冲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 221560,
      "end_ms": 223625,
      "text": "潮汕人真的把信仰做到了极致，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 223930,
      "end_ms": 226130,
      "text": "就算是莺歌陆逊遇到台风、暴雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 226230,
      "end_ms": 228750,
      "text": "孩子们也是迎难而上整个村子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 228750,
      "end_ms": 230815,
      "text": "少男少女发动全村来训练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 231070,
      "end_ms": 231830,
      "text": "没有人缺席，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00127",
      "start_ms": 231830,
      "end_ms": 232570,
      "text": "没有人推脱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00128",
      "start_ms": 232650,
      "end_ms": 234075,
      "text": "没有任何金钱报酬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00129",
      "start_ms": 234420,
      "end_ms": 237645,
      "text": "而今年潮汕揭阳新兵入也是莺歌舞开路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00130",
      "start_ms": 238060,
      "end_ms": 241925,
      "text": "潮汕宗祠在当地捐了许多免费的养老院和儿童福利院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00131",
      "start_ms": 242210,
      "end_ms": 244770,
      "text": "很多叔公阿姨在膳堂做了一辈子义工。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00132",
      "start_ms": 244970,
      "end_ms": 245330,
      "text": "这一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00133",
      "start_ms": 245330,
      "end_ms": 245855,
      "text": "我相信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00134",
      "start_ms": 246150,
      "end_ms": 247650,
      "text": "如果世间有神明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00135",
      "start_ms": 247650,
      "end_ms": 248925,
      "text": "那一定在汕头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00136",
      "start_ms": 249220,
      "end_ms": 252740,
      "text": "你看这是潮汕的妈祖花灯巡游掉队的父子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00137",
      "start_ms": 252740,
      "end_ms": 255080,
      "text": "全场围观的都是善意的鼓励，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00138",
      "start_ms": 255120,
      "end_ms": 256095,
      "text": "没有什么嘲讽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00139",
      "start_ms": 256510,
      "end_ms": 257930,
      "text": "爸爸全力抱起儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00140",
      "start_ms": 257930,
      "end_ms": 259335,
      "text": "最后冲刺进祠堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00141",
      "start_ms": 259670,
      "end_ms": 263070,
      "text": "宗族对一个垫底的落后的弟子都那么爱护顾虑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00142",
      "start_ms": 263170,
      "end_ms": 265505,
      "text": "可想这样的宗族会一直强盛下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00143",
      "start_ms": 265750,
      "end_ms": 267665,
      "text": "信仰的背后是人情味，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00144",
      "start_ms": 267940,
      "end_ms": 270810,
      "text": "所以潮商很喜欢自己人帮自己人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00145",
      "start_ms": 270950,
      "end_ms": 272950,
      "text": "而你知道潮汕人有多牛吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00146",
      "start_ms": 273070,
      "end_ms": 273750,
      "text": "香港首富，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00147",
      "start_ms": 273750,
      "end_ms": 274250,
      "text": "李嘉诚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00148",
      "start_ms": 274330,
      "end_ms": 275510,
      "text": "泰国首富谢国民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00149",
      "start_ms": 275630,
      "end_ms": 278365,
      "text": "新加坡首富吴清亮、亚洲首富陈碧晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00150",
      "start_ms": 278620,
      "end_ms": 281695,
      "text": "世界上最富有的十二大银行家都是潮汕人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00151",
      "start_ms": 282020,
      "end_ms": 283820,
      "text": "全球一百位华人首富当中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00152",
      "start_ms": 283900,
      "end_ms": 285425,
      "text": "潮汕人占了三分之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00153",
      "start_ms": 285830,
      "end_ms": 288935,
      "text": "欧美各地的华人首富也全都是潮汕人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00154",
      "start_ms": 289230,
      "end_ms": 292475,
      "text": "就连泰国王室的祖先正姓大帝也是潮汕人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00155",
      "start_ms": 292650,
      "end_ms": 295025,
      "text": "是中国历史上第一位在海外称帝的华人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00156",
      "start_ms": 295410,
      "end_ms": 297030,
      "text": "泰国十大富豪有八位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00157",
      "start_ms": 297090,
      "end_ms": 298085,
      "text": "都是潮汕人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00158",
      "start_ms": 298430,
      "end_ms": 299610,
      "text": "有潮水的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00159",
      "start_ms": 299650,
      "end_ms": 300795,
      "text": "就有潮汕人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00160",
      "start_ms": 301290,
      "end_ms": 301690,
      "text": "诸君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00161",
      "start_ms": 301810,
      "end_ms": 302910,
      "text": "你知道民间哪里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00162",
      "start_ms": 302910,
      "end_ms": 303770,
      "text": "神仙最多吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00163",
      "start_ms": 303810,
      "end_ms": 305650,
      "text": "当属潮汕天庭的收入，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00164",
      "start_ms": 305650,
      "end_ms": 306890,
      "text": "据说一半靠潮汕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00165",
      "start_ms": 307290,
      "end_ms": 308810,
      "text": "若是见到天帝父母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00166",
      "start_ms": 308810,
      "end_ms": 309390,
      "text": "这样的标识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00167",
      "start_ms": 309410,
      "end_ms": 312930,
      "text": "拜的就是天宫玉皇大帝和他的妻子后土娘娘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00168",
      "start_ms": 313130,
      "end_ms": 315690,
      "text": "若是见到白脸红脸、黑脸一起出现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00169",
      "start_ms": 315750,
      "end_ms": 318250,
      "text": "就潮汕顶流老爷三山国王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00170",
      "start_ms": 318550,
      "end_ms": 319870,
      "text": "若是位于灶台之上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00171",
      "start_ms": 319870,
      "end_ms": 321370,
      "text": "则是最不能得罪的神明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00172",
      "start_ms": 321630,
      "end_ms": 323870,
      "text": "司命公张丹也被称之为灶神，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00173",
      "start_ms": 323950,
      "end_ms": 324890,
      "text": "是百姓的家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00174",
      "start_ms": 324890,
      "end_ms": 328250,
      "text": "内神就是先谱圣庙风雨圣者升殿一事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00175",
      "start_ms": 328650,
      "end_ms": 330410,
      "text": "我一直以为我们没有汉文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00176",
      "start_ms": 330450,
      "end_ms": 332580,
      "text": "没想到汉文话都在广东潮汕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00177",
      "start_ms": 332880,
      "end_ms": 334220,
      "text": "无论何时何地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00178",
      "start_ms": 334220,
      "end_ms": 335820,
      "text": "只要一句老要保侯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00179",
      "start_ms": 335900,
      "end_ms": 337500,
      "text": "就能给潮汕人注入力量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00180",
      "start_ms": 337700,
      "end_ms": 338400,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00181",
      "start_ms": 338580,
      "end_ms": 341560,
      "text": "潮汕祭祖最重要的不是求祖先保佑我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00182",
      "start_ms": 341720,
      "end_ms": 342820,
      "text": "而是提醒自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00183",
      "start_ms": 342860,
      "end_ms": 343960,
      "text": "别辜负祖先，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00184",
      "start_ms": 344220,
      "end_ms": 345580,
      "text": "我不能给祖先丢人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00185",
      "start_ms": 345900,
      "end_ms": 347820,
      "text": "没有谁是真正的白手企业家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00186",
      "start_ms": 347920,
      "end_ms": 350420,
      "text": "你的起点就是祖辈几代人的终点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00187",
      "start_ms": 350740,
      "end_ms": 352160,
      "text": "一个家族最贵的遗产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00188",
      "start_ms": 352360,
      "end_ms": 353880,
      "text": "不是上一代留下多少钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00189",
      "start_ms": 354280,
      "end_ms": 355120,
      "text": "而是下一代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00190",
      "start_ms": 355120,
      "end_ms": 356160,
      "text": "提起这个家族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00191",
      "start_ms": 356160,
      "end_ms": 356940,
      "text": "就会说一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00192",
      "start_ms": 357200,
      "end_ms": 360120,
      "text": "我们家祖祖辈辈都是认真生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0d39c6dc7d4087f4_s00193",
      "start_ms": 360320,
      "end_ms": 361595,
      "text": "堂堂正正的人。"
    }
  ],
